                                "sense_id": "28d9b981-6b6d-3e57-bb7b-9b3a69308710",
                                "text": "In many programming languages, numeric values are not assignable to string variables."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96cd8a20-d623-44a3-b611-9fbedec269f6",
                                "sense_id": "28d9b981-6b6d-3e57-bb7b-9b3a69308710",
                                "text": "First, we were forced to infer era of service from birthdate, resulting in a relatively small number of respondents assignable to the post-EO era veterans condition."
